{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Up to 8-player multiplayer\u3011</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Life-or-Death Bridge Construction Begins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the effects of global warming, Antarctica has splintered into many pieces. Your goal is to connect the fragmented pieces by building bridges, linking them back together! You can go solo or cooperate with others in multiplayer to make Antarctica whole again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect the bridge to the designated location. That\u2019s all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STEP 1: Plan</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The stages are randomly generated each time. Think carefully about where you need to connect from and to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STEP 2: Construct the Bridge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gather materials and turn them into lumber. Then, glue them together to build a bridge. But be careful\u2014if you build it poorly or if everyone gets on it at the same time, the weight will cause it to collapse. And falling into the sea means instant death. Try your best to reinforce the bridge or find reinforcement items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STEP 3: Transport the Cargo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Once the bridge is complete, carry heavy supplies to the other side. A bridge isn't a bridge if it collapses under that kind of weight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Complete the project by the specified date. At night, be careful not to get eaten by orcas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Version</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A demo version will be released once the game is sufficiently complete. Development progress will be posted on Twitter (new X) as it happens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regarding Videos and Streams</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Playthrough videos and streams are welcome. Please confirm the following two points:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include the game's name in the title. (Required)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include the Steam store page URL in the description. (Optional)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969510?t=1765360479","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969510?t=1765360479","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969510/a9bb9874292bea7a9b8cd9ac38468834fcb46229/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765360479","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969510/a9bb9874292bea7a9b8cd9ac38468834fcb46229/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765360479","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Up to 8-player multiplayer\u3011</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Life-or-Death Bridge Construction Begins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the effects of global warming, Antarctica has splintered into many pieces. Your goal is to connect the fragmented pieces by building bridges, linking them back together! You can go solo or cooperate with others in multiplayer to make Antarctica whole again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect the bridge to the designated location. That\u2019s all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STEP 1: Plan</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The stages are randomly generated each time. Think carefully about where you need to connect from and to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STEP 2: Construct the Bridge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gather materials and turn them into lumber. Then, glue them together to build a bridge. But be careful\u2014if you build it poorly or if everyone gets on it at the same time, the weight will cause it to collapse. And falling into the sea means instant death. Try your best to reinforce the bridge or find reinforcement items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STEP 3: Transport the Cargo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Once the bridge is complete, carry heavy supplies to the other side. A bridge isn't a bridge if it collapses under that kind of weight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Complete the project by the specified date. At night, be careful not to get eaten by orcas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Version</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A demo version will be released once the game is sufficiently complete. Development progress will be posted on Twitter (new X) as it happens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regarding Videos and Streams</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Playthrough videos and streams are welcome. Please confirm the following two points:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include the game's name in the title. (Required)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include the Steam store page URL in the description. (Optional)</p></li></ul>","developers":["lemorion_1224"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Epic Online Services ","genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969510/bcfab5c08eb9d1d555c8c81dabd8389a9604d0d0/header.jpg?t=1765360479","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"LINK","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit.<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 or 12 compatible graphics card</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["lemorion_1224"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q1 2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969510/21c54915deae15558778f1fd2a9635e58c2743f3/ss_21c54915deae15558778f1fd2a9635e58c2743f3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1765360479","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969510/21c54915deae15558778f1fd2a9635e58c2743f3/ss_21c54915deae15558778f1fd2a9635e58c2743f3.600x338.jpg?t=1765360479"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969510/1b54d239dc6f42e4b2da999b9db7617b84755338/ss_1b54d239dc6f42e4b2da999b9db7617b84755338.1920x1080.jpg?t=1765360479","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969510/1b54d239dc6f42e4b2da999b9db7617b84755338/ss_1b54d239dc6f42